    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no \"fixing\" it? what if the person i was is just gone? it feels like i'm just an empty shell waiting to be hollowed out completely. if the core of me is already gone, then i'm not even really living, am i? im just a ghost haunting my own body. it feels more like a burden than a life at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
