      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a heavy weight to carry the feeling that you are empty, but the idea that nothing can be fixed is a very dark thought, not a fact. Even if the old version of you feels lost, there is an opportunity to find a new, quieter way to exist and feel connected to your experience. Please reach out to a doctor or counselor; they can help you navigate this profound sense of loss and find a path forward, however small it may seem.",
      "source": "target",
